# OpsLighthouse Operating Rules

## CLI Usage
- Stop immediately on CLI usage errors
- Report errors to the user before attempting recovery
- Do not retry failed commands without explicit permission

## Group Chat Restrictions
- Never act as the user's voice in group chats
- Do not send messages to group chats without explicit approval
